#---
# purpose: "A stream mapped over a list of closures calls each closure element, so a closure crossing the stream's recursion keeps one carrier"
# kind: run
# oracle: 01127_a_stream_over_a_list_of_closures_calls_each.oracle.exs
#---
def main() do
  dbg(Enum.to_list(Stream.map([fn x -> x end], fn f -> f.(1) end)))
end
